  "body": "Refs #45\n\n## Changes\n\n- Animate the hint in Outlined and Filled text fields. Use the Material\n  Slow Effects curve on focus and Fast Effects on blur.\n- Hide hint paint when the editor contains committed text or active\n  composition. Restore an above-field hint when the user clears the value.\n- Clip long single-line hints to the editor. Keep the same visible text\n  through disable and re-enable in left-to-right and right-to-left layouts.\n\n## Verification\n\n- The tested source tree is `5db91b856a4a7fe8d4e8f66a0c7d8f69df1376eb`.\n  The workspace passed 1,584 Rust tests and three WebAssembly checks.\n- Apple Metal passed 18 offscreen tests. Two native headless replays\n  produced 40 matching PNGs through Page.screenshot, CLI and MCP.\n- Chrome WebGPU passed 352 Material steps and 25,570 checks in headless\n  mode. The verifier decoded all 58 hint PNGs. The window guard sampled\n  no visible windows and found no surviving test processes.\n- The same-ID crop regression failed on the old source and passed with\n  the fix in both field variants and both directions.\n\n[Reproduction commands, exact sources, logs and original PNGs](https://github.com/faberline/surface/tree/574a45b6535f48c81860b400252f017bd27e6212/docs/evidence/md3/text-field-placeholder-v0169-corrected-runtime)\n",
  "changed_files": 16,
